<title>HONG KONG: Companion Marble names exec director.</title>
<headline>Companion Marble names exec director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Companion Marble (Holdings) Ltd said on Tuesday it has appointed Douglas Chan Wing-tak as an executive director with effect from February 28.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
